               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>Please use the details exactly as described above. Do not chang</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>Please use the details exactly as described above. Do not change the account name or account details, as your payment will otherwise be rejected by our system. Account names are generated to be unique for each transaction so that we can identify your payments more quickly.</photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>To complete the transaction, the payment must be made via elect</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>To complete the transaction, the payment must be made via electronic bank transfer. A transfer is a method of transferring money from one person or institution (entity) to another. A transfer can be made from one bank account to another or through a cash transfer at a cashier.</photoshop:LayerText>
